# POTFILES.in — source files containing translatable strings for namtor-kde.
# Used by xgettext with the Qt parser to produce namtor-kde.pot.
#
# One path per line, relative to the repo root. Only user-visible strings
# (labels, button text, dialog messages, accessibility names) are extracted;
# no biometric data, thresholds, or model identifiers appear in translatable
# strings. KDE's i18n() calls in QML are the extraction target.
crates/namtor-kde/qml/main.qml
